      "content": "that makes sense. but if the weight of these rules is mostly falling on people like me, doesn't that make the whole thing kind of unfair? like, if the \"environmental benefits\" are being bought at the cost of destroying small local businesses, is it even a good policy? it feels like we're being told it's for the greater good, but the math just doesn't add up for us.",
